<p>Of course, with all this avian activity around, it was inevitable that 
someone would be hit by a bird bomb. And, since Michael was around, 
it was inevitable that he be the target.</p>

<p>Luckily this happened about the time we'd decided to leave anyway. But Mikey 
insisted that Michael either remove his soiled shirt, or ride home in the back 
of the truck.</p>

<p>Michael chose to remove his shirt. And, since we were in Florida, that only 
meant that he was appropriately dressed to receive visitors.</p>

<img src="IMG_0059.JPG" alt="Bombs away!">

